<%# THE MATERIAL ESTIMATE'S CARD (2026-11-22), drawn first under Look inside a file
    (Tools::HomeController::BUILT_IN): a PAGE, unlike the calculator's modal, so its title is a link
    there, stretched over the card the way an addon card's is (pages/tools.css `.addon-card-link`).
    No Open button (2026-11-23, the owner's call): the card is the way in, as every other card is.
    `.tool-card`, never `.addon-card`, for the reason tools/home/_calculator_card gives. %>
<%= tag.div class: "tool-card", id: "material",
            data: tool_menu_data(Maker::ToolPins::MATERIAL, "Material estimate") do %>
  <span class="addon-card-head">
    <span class="addon-icon" aria-hidden="true"><%= rail_icon(:tools) %></span>
    <%= link_to "Material estimate", tools_material_path, class: "addon-title addon-card-link", id: "tool-title-material" %>
  </span>
  <span class="addon-desc muted">How many sheets of stock a set of SVG, LightBurn, DXF or MillMage
    files needs, with each part's size and the total area.</span>
<% end %>
